{"nodes": [{"id": "racas_humanos_carrossel_heroi", "label": "Carrossel her\u00f3i dos membros", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Autoplay ~7s com pausa por motivo; hover-pause vive APENAS no palco (stageFrame): pausar no her\u00f3i de ~100vh inteiro matava o autoplay com o mouse parado em qualquer lugar, enquanto focusin pode ficar no bloco todo por a11y; trocas via WAAPI \u2014 o fill forwards da anima\u00e7\u00e3o de SA\u00cdDA persistia para sempre e invisibilizava a coluna de texto ap\u00f3s a 1\u00aa troca, corrigido com inn.finished.then(() => out.cancel()); deep-link #id + listener hashchange para same-document."}, {"id": "racas_humanos_payload_race_data", "label": "Payload embutido #race-data", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "JSON da ra\u00e7a (folder, label, color, icon, lore, tipo, regioes, count), membros completos, vizinhos prev/next e allRaces das 21 ra\u00e7as embutido num <script type=application/json> dentro do HTML: as 21 p\u00e1ginas funcionam em file:// sem backend \u2014 decis\u00e3o aprovada no plano proud-dreaming-bubble das p\u00e1ginas de ra\u00e7a."}, {"id": "racas_humanos_ficha_lateral", "label": "Ficha lateral com os 6 atributos", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "racas_humanos_navegacao_entre_racas", "label": "Navega\u00e7\u00e3o entre as 21 ra\u00e7as", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "racas_humanos_reveals_a_prova_de_falha", "label": "Reveals \u00e0 prova de falha (progressive enhancement)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cards/se\u00e7\u00f5es VIS\u00cdVEIS por padr\u00e3o no CSS; .pre-reveal (oculto) aplicado via JS S\u00d3 quando IntersectionObserver existe, imediatamente antes de observar; sweep de 900ms revela qualquer .pre-reveal j\u00e1 na viewport caso o IO morra silenciosamente. Hardening que ficou do bug dos reveals: o IO era INOCENTE \u2014 scroll-behavior:smooth transformava cada window.scrollTo do dance do teste em ANIMA\u00c7\u00c3O, os degraus se sobrepunham e a p\u00e1gina nunca chegava ao acervo; sem JS/sem IO/IO morto = conte\u00fado sempre vis\u00edvel."}, {"id": "racas_assets_raca_css", "label": "raca.css", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Folha compartilhada das 21 p\u00e1ginas de ra\u00e7a (~1500 linhas): tokens dark-first espelhando o index, her\u00f3i cinematogr\u00e1fico, palco com tilt/glare/Ken Burns, breakpoints 1100/900/560, prefers-reduced-motion."}, {"id": "racas_assets_raca_js", "label": "raca.js", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Script compartilhado das 21 p\u00e1ginas (~780 linhas): carrossel com autoplay e pausas por motivo, WAAPI nas trocas, reveal por caractere, tilt 3D, part\u00edculas Canvas, dots com barra de progresso, deep-link #id + hashchange, ficha lateral com os 6 atributos, tema persistido em localStorage.racasTheme, acervo clic\u00e1vel, prev/next e \u00edndice das 21 ra\u00e7as."}, {"id": "racas_humanos_showcase_humanos", "label": "Showcase Humanos", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "P\u00e1gina da ra\u00e7a Humanos (01_Humanos, 30 membros, Territorial) do template gerado por scripts/build_racas.ps1: her\u00f3i rotativo dos membros, lore, acervo completo e navega\u00e7\u00e3o entre as 21 ra\u00e7as; dados embutidos para file://."}, {"id": "racas_humanos_humanos", "label": "Humanos", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "racas_humanos_showcase_humanos", "target": "index_aetheria_codex_galeria", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "racas_humanos_showcase_humanos", "target": "mapa_aetheria_mesa_de_guerra_arcana", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "racas_humanos_showcase_humanos", "target": "racas_humanos_humanos", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "racas_humanos_showcase_humanos", "target": "racas_humanos_payload_race_data", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "racas_humanos_showcase_humanos", "target": "racas_assets_raca_css", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "racas_humanos_showcase_humanos", "target": "racas_assets_raca_js", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "racas/humanos.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "racas_humanos_s